{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nilo wakes up in a dream land, armed with a weaponized umbrella to fend off hostile creatures in this out of this world landscape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tight, souls-like combat where each encounter requires patience and intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge to avoid enemy attacks, jab to whittle down foes\u2019 health, then <strong>parry </strong>attacks at the right moment to open up enemies to crushing blows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/5d50116c2015effa5e27decee98927e8.poster.avif?t=1759549222\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/5d50116c2015effa5e27decee98927e8.webm?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/5d50116c2015effa5e27decee98927e8.mp4?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome more than 20 bosses! Battle towering foes and conquer unique challenges that will push Nilo to his limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/458e618ce73fc28b379c0b2fd76cdb49.poster.avif?t=1759549222\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/458e618ce73fc28b379c0b2fd76cdb49.webm?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/458e618ce73fc28b379c0b2fd76cdb49.mp4?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/934a522a1be3fe17edb77c2642d211b3.poster.avif?t=1759549222\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/934a522a1be3fe17edb77c2642d211b3.webm?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/934a522a1be3fe17edb77c2642d211b3.mp4?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and master 4 powerful secondary weapons and a diverse set of lethal abilities and game changing Dream Fragments, enabling new combat mechanics, ways to solve puzzles, and navigate the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash special attacks and abilities wisely, as they share the same pool of energy as Nilo\u2019s healing items!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/c81cd6fd11fca55157aee7d454dd482b.poster.avif?t=1759549222\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/c81cd6fd11fca55157aee7d454dd482b.webm?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/c81cd6fd11fca55157aee7d454dd482b.mp4?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the meaning behind the strange, shadowy figures of this world, and find a long-lost friend that holds a special connection with Niko in his waking hours\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a hand-crafted world where beauty and horror intertwine. Uncover long buried truths, face twisted memories, and piece together the fragments of a broken past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/090438f11480417e9eb04efeed27dbe1.poster.avif?t=1759549222\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/090438f11480417e9eb04efeed27dbe1.webm?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/090438f11480417e9eb04efeed27dbe1.mp4?t=1759549222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3240610?t=1759549222","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3240610?t=1759549222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/94a0f8d94d233b98a9b7d56af8b4b4cf41bc5643/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759549222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/94a0f8d94d233b98a9b7d56af8b4b4cf41bc5643/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759549222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"id